{"units":[{"n":"m1-Ms","d":"Faluns de Saucats à faciès marneux dominants : marnes sableuses gris-bleu à rares coquilles alternant avec des faluns argileux plus riches en coquilles, base des faluns, souvent rataché au Chattien (Aquitanien marin)","l":"Marl","a":["Chattian – Aquitanian","Neogene","Cenozoic",28.1,20.44,0],"o":70,"dp":"33","c":"#ffff4d"},{"n":"m2-G","d":"Grès à Miogypsines : grès à miogypsines et calcaires gréseux microcristalins (Faciès local). Equivalents des Faluns de Leognan (Burdigalien marin)","l":"Limestone","a":["Burdigalian","Neogene","Cenozoic",20.44,15.97,0],"o":67,"dp":"33","c":"#ffff80"},{"n":"SL","d":"Sables des Landes : sables eoliens homométriques jaunâtres à blancs à paléosols noirs et ferricrètes (\"garluche\") rougeâtre (Pléistocène indifférencié)","l":"Sand","a":["Pleistocene","Quaternary","Cenozoic",2.58,0.01,0],"o":51,"dp":"33","c":"#ffffbf"},{"n":"Fz-T","d":"Alluvions actuelles : sables et tourbes fluvio-lacustre (Atlantique sup. à actuel)","l":"Sand","a":["Holocene","Quaternary","Cenozoic",0.01,0,1],"o":33,"dp":"33","c":"#ffffff"},{"n":"Fy3-z","d":"Alluvions subactuelles à actuelles indiféernéciées : argiles siltueuses, argiles sableuses, argiles tourbeuses, sables argileux, sables fins à graviers (Pré-boréal à actuel)","l":"Clay","a":["Holocene","Quaternary","Cenozoic",0.01,0,1],"o":34,"dp":"33","c":"#ffffff"},{"n":"m1-Cg","d":"Calcaire Gris de l'Agenais : calcaire lacustre et palustre gris à beige clair, caverneux à planorbes, limnées, marno-calcaires à silex (Aquitanien sup. continental)","l":"Marl","a":["Aquitanian","Neogene","Cenozoic",23.03,20.44,0],"o":72,"dp":"33","c":"#ffff00"},{"n":"D-p","d":"Dunes paraboliques continentales anciennes (Boréal à Sub-Boréal)","l":"Beach sand and dunes","a":["Quaternary","Quaternary","Cenozoic",2.58,0,1],"o":31,"dp":"33","c":"#ffffbf"},{"n":"m4V","d":"Formation des Sables Verts : sables fins à moyens argileux micacés et glauconieux vert-olive à kaki, à bioclastes (débris de lammelibranches